63 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 32 0 R
/E (After Eid, order volume surged dramatically to 7.7, but sales volume was only 2.9, meaning that the gap between order quantity and quantity sold in the post-Eid period was quite significant, resulting in excess inventory, which was likely the cause of the sharp decline in Fresh Food margins during that period. The fact that orders were 2.5 times higher than usual was the main factor behind the increase in shrinkage rates and reactive discounts during that period.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
