99 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 33 0 R
/E (The gross profit margin declined not because of sluggish sales, but because the Fresh Food division faced several issues during the post-Eid period: \(1\) shrinkage surged due to over-ordering, \(2\) reactive discounts had to be offered to clear out fresh food inventory nearing its expiration date, and \(3\) purchase prices from suppliers rose. The root cause was that the purchasing team failed to adjust order quantities to account for the post-Eid decline in demand. This combination of three factors contributed to a 6% decline in margins for Fresh Food during the post-Eid period.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
